00:17:56.580 --> 00:17:58.560
Oh! Help!

00:17:58.560 --> 00:18:01.620
Hikaru!

00:18:04.760 --> 00:18:07.190
I've no choice but to use the Power.

00:18:07.660 --> 00:18:11.150
If I can't even move that boat a little,
I'm not a man!

00:18:17.070 --> 00:18:20.040
I... I cannot swim!

00:18:23.540 --> 00:18:26.620
Now that I think about it...
I used up the Power while...

00:18:26.620 --> 00:18:29.270
...I was practicing tennis with Ayukawa.

00:18:30.650 --> 00:18:33.620
Really... you're such a troublemaker!

00:18:39.430 --> 00:18:41.970
Hikaru!

00:18:41.970 --> 00:18:44.030
Pfhht!

00:18:44.530 --> 00:18:47.830
Hikaru...

00:18:56.780 --> 00:18:59.870
Darling... you have no idea... just how I'm feeling.

00:19:10.920 --> 00:19:13.890
I'm sorry... it was all my fault.

00:19:16.260 --> 00:19:17.830
I'd like to make it up to you.

00:19:17.830 --> 00:19:17.970
Huh?

00:19:17.970 --> 00:19:20.700
Come on...
Huh?

00:19:21.070 --> 00:19:24.120
Kasuga is asleep...
he said he was exhausted.

00:19:24.120 --> 00:19:26.000
I see...

00:19:30.080 --> 00:19:33.410
I have someone... who's
willing to spend time with me.

00:19:35.450 --> 00:19:37.960
Aren't you going to the dance, Madoka?

00:19:37.960 --> 00:19:39.930
No. I'll pass.

00:19:39.930 --> 00:19:42.700
Not tonight... I'm just not in the mood.

00:19:42.700 --> 00:19:45.540
I see... Well, then...

00:19:45.540 --> 00:19:48.930
Hikaru, does Kasuga know?

00:19:50.030 --> 00:19:52.030
I know it's none of my business, but...

00:19:52.030 --> 00:19:54.000
I'd better get going.
I know it's none of my business, but...

00:19:54.640 --> 00:19:57.100
Hikaru...

00:20:16.260 --> 00:20:19.230
Who's there?

00:20:20.830 --> 00:20:23.020
Sorry, but Hikaru isn't here.

00:20:23.430 --> 00:20:26.060
I see.

00:20:26.600 --> 00:20:29.570
Actually, I don't care... about a kid like that.

00:20:31.510 --> 00:20:34.470
What a beautiful moonlit night.

00:20:35.440 --> 00:20:39.400
And, shining in the moonlight, you are... beautiful.

00:20:53.330 --> 00:20:55.280
I'm the captain of the Tennis Club.

00:20:55.280 --> 00:20:57.760
Everybody wants to be with me all the time.

00:21:29.760 --> 00:21:33.670
Don't get so cocky! You couldn't
save a girl even if you wanted to!

00:21:48.050 --> 00:21:51.180
I can't believe it!
How dare you look so happy?!

00:21:54.420 --> 00:21:58.080
Don't you care if something happens between me and Kitakata?

00:21:59.430 --> 00:22:00.390
H...Hikaru!

00:22:00.390 --> 00:22:01.560
Oh!
H...Hikaru!

00:22:01.560 --> 00:22:01.630
Hikaru! Watch out!
Oh!

00:22:01.630 --> 00:22:03.760
Hikaru! Watch out!

00:22:09.970 --> 00:22:12.120
Darling!

00:22:12.120 --> 00:22:16.730
"The water is very cold!
You'll have a heart attack!"

00:22:24.590 --> 00:22:27.550
I'm... sorry...

00:22:34.900 --> 00:22:37.860
Oh! Kitakata!

00:22:40.030 --> 00:22:43.020
So beautiful...

00:22:43.020 --> 00:22:44.770
You shine in the moonlight...

00:22:44.770 --> 00:22:46.740
Good night!
You shine in the moonlight...

00:22:49.310 --> 00:22:51.740
...not beaufiful!

00:22:51.910 --> 00:22:54.640
Madoka!

00:22:54.820 --> 00:22:57.780
Hikaru?

00:22:58.820 --> 00:23:01.790
Tonight, let's drink 'til dawn, girl!

00:23:02.490 --> 00:23:03.180
Yeah!

00:23:08.730 --> 00:23:10.360
At that moment, even though I was...

00:23:10.360 --> 00:23:15.490
...dreaming of being
strangled by Hikaru in the lake...

00:23:15.490 --> 00:23:19.060
...somehow, it suddenly changed
to one in which she gave me a kiss.

00:23:20.910 --> 00:23:24.870
I had absolutely no idea why that happened.

00:23:36.220 --> 00:23:40.510
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:23:40.510 --> 00:23:44.770
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:23:44.770 --> 00:23:49.110
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:23:49.110 --> 00:23:53.350
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:23:53.350 --> 00:24:01.230
On that last night we went out for a drive,
I left my go-out voice behind.

00:24:01.230 --> 00:24:10.730
As we watched the horizon, I said good-bye.

00:24:10.730 --> 00:24:18.540
Like seasons, hit songs come and go...
As you get used to one, you're tired of it.

00:24:18.540 --> 00:24:27.220
That's what's written on your profile.

00:24:27.220 --> 00:24:36.930
You were waiting for
the lucky star in your room...

00:24:36.930 --> 00:24:45.300
...I was too late to notice it in that one phone call that day.

00:24:45.300 --> 00:24:49.640
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It began in the summer..."

00:24:49.640 --> 00:24:53.980
Hold me, Hold me, Hold me, Fire Love.
"It burnt up in the fall..."

00:24:53.980 --> 00:24:58.280
Broken Heart is in Flames.
"It's withering in the winter..."

00:24:58.280 --> 00:25:02.620
Flare, Flare, Flare like the Sun, Fire Love...

00:25:02.620 --> 00:25:07.440
Erase the memory of you from me...
"Stop, Stop, Stop."

00:25:12.950 --> 00:25:18.470
A girl that I just met, Kumiko, suddenly told me "Go ahead."

00:25:18.470 --> 00:25:22.240
As a man, if I don't do anything in that kind of a situation...

00:25:22.240 --> 00:25:22.300
"Summer experience":
euphemism for losing one's virginity.

00:25:22.300 --> 00:25:26.430
Should it be that way,
or should I get a "summer experience?"

00:25:26.430 --> 00:25:26.480
"Summer experience":
euphemism for losing one's virginity.

00:25:26.480 --> 00:25:31.250
Next time: "Kyosuke in a Pinch.
Sweet Nothings at the Wuthering Heights."

00:25:31.250 --> 00:25:34.270
I... feel like Hamlet!
